    {
      "q": "How do I manage my employee's pay and taxes?",
      "a": "You can register for Pay As You Go (PAYG) withholding, use the tax withheld calculator, and check award rates, pay and wages.",
      "link": "https://www.service.nsw.gov.au/referral/register-for-pay-as-you-go-payg-withholding"
    },
    {
      "q": "What are the requirements for employee leave?",
      "a": "You can find information on how to comply with long service leave requirements.",
      "link": "https://www.service.nsw.gov.au/referral/comply-with-long-service-leave-requirements"
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I handle superannuation contributions?",
      "a": "You can use calculators and tools to manage superannuation guarantee contributions, pay contributions via SuperStream, or learn about the Small Business Superannuation Clearing House (SBSCH).",
